From: johnv8 <johnv8@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 01:45:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 28/34] E10c v2: A0 (normy+kwantyzacja, nt blokow), A1 (mmvq
 hc_down jak stock + silu, ostatni blok kwantyzuje lo), B1 (mmvq hc_up + mix,
 320 blokow); domyslnie OFF do walidacji

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/common.cuh  |  19 +-
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/hc-block.cu | 427 +++++++++++++--------------------
 2 files changed, 185 insertions(+), 261 deletions(-)

